                                        "entry_id": "953ad3eb-9265-3811-aafb-0e0f6229cbe1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A stiff petticoat made from this fabric."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "51cd27d6-9ae5-4958-9a13-8530e39215d0",
                                                "sense_id": "62d07f71-750d-3e31-afdf-7baab36e1649",
                                                "text": "These standards have not just been oppressive but deadly. In the nineteenth century, stiff crinoline petticoats puffed out skirts so far that the cheap materials often brushed against open flames and caught fire. This arbitrary convention of dress caused three thousand women to be burned alive."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
